OL,3,GNEWSAPolice warn of rise in vape and
OL,4,Amedicine spiking
OL,5,
OL,6,FPredators are increasingly using
OL,7,Fprescription drugs, over-the-counter
OL,8,Fmedication and drug-laced vapes to
OL,9,Fspike victims, the Metropolitan Police
OL,10,Fhas said.
OL,12,FLondon detectives have seen cases
OL,13,Finvolving vapes containing THC or
OL,14,FSpice, alongside high doses of everyday
OL,15,Fmedicines like antihistamines and
OL,16,Ftravel sickness pills that cause
OL,17,Fdrowsiness.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
