OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPolice warn of rise in vape and
OL,4,Amedicine spiking
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile spiking is traditionally linked
OL,7,Fto bars and clubs, officers are also
OL,8,Finvestigating incidents at house
OL,9,Fparties, student accommodation and
OL,10,Fother private settings.
OL,12,FMore than 2,700 spiking-related
OL,13,Foffences have been reported to the Met
OL,14,Fin the past year. Just 131 led to a
OL,15,Fcharge, caution or summons ` though
OL,16,Fthis is up 20% on the previous year.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
